{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44248586",
      "title": "Managing Form Status with Form Actions",
      "sourceHash": "bb031d4874afe46d21372c00b1bb6f3d1a513372752c988f51deb42b8a526ea2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 1.68,
          "en": "Now, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.68,
          "end": 4.44,
          "en": "now that I'm using this formActions feature here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.44,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "I also, again, wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 9.42,
          "en": "that we show this Sending order data text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.42,
          "end": 12.033,
          "en": "whilst the order is on its way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.2,
          "end": 15.75,
          "en": "and since we're using formActions here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15.75,
          "end": 20.07,
          "en": "we actually no longer have to manage that state manually,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.07,
          "end": 24,
          "en": "so I don't care about this isLoading state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "that's returned by my useHttp hook anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 32.73,
          "en": "I don't need it anymore, so I won't extract it here anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 33.9,
          "en": "It was nice to have it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.9,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "but now we don't need that extra information from here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 42.33,
          "en": "because I am awaiting my sendRquest call here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.33,
          "end": 44.25,
          "en": "in my formAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.25,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "and as you learned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 50.01,
          "en": "earlier in the course in this section about formActions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.01,
          "end": 54.81,
          "en": "you can now use another hook offered by React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.81,
          "end": 57.69,
          "en": "the useActionState hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.69,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "to get information about the current form status,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.33,
          "end": 62.58,
          "en": "so whether it's pending or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.58,
          "end": 65.52,
          "en": "Alternatively, in some nested component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.52,
          "end": 67.53,
          "en": "you could use the form status hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.53,
          "end": 70.593,
          "en": "but here, I'll use the useActionState hook instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.63,
          "end": 75.21000000000001,
          "en": "Now, therefore, all I have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.21000000000001,
          "end": 78.93,
          "en": "is go below my checkoutAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 78.93,
          "end": 81.72,
          "en": "and then, here call useActionState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.72,
          "end": 85.14,
          "en": "and pass the checkoutAction to it as a first argument",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.14,
          "end": 87.90299999999999,
          "en": "and the second argument is my initial formState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.80799999999999,
          "end": 91.53,
          "en": "and here, for the moment, I'll set this to null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.53,
          "end": 95.00999999999999,
          "en": "Now, as a result, I'll get back my updated formState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.00999999999999,
          "end": 96.723,
          "en": "about which I don't care here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 97.8,
          "end": 101.65,
          "en": "but I then also get back my updated formAction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 102.533,
          "end": 105.57,
          "en": "and this pending state information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.57,
          "end": 108.63300000000001,
          "en": "so this pending value, which is true or false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 110.82,
          "end": 114.87,
          "en": "It's now this formAction that should be set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.87,
          "end": 118.65299999999999,
          "en": "for this action prop on the form, like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 125.61,
          "en": "and it's the pending value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 125.61,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "which I wanna use to show this Sending order data text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 133.68,
          "en": "Now, here I'm checking for a variable named isSending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.68,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "so either we replace this with pending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 139.89,
          "en": "or I use isSending here as a name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.89,
          "end": 141.54,
          "en": "when destructuring this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.54,
          "end": 142.743,
          "en": "and I'll do the latter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 145.56,
          "end": 148.71,
          "en": "With that done, again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 148.71,
          "end": 152.07,
          "en": "if I add items to the cart, and I go to the Checkout page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.07,
          "end": 154.293,
          "en": "and I enter some information here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.79,
          "end": 161.49,
          "en": "like this, if I click Submit Order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.49,
          "end": 164.913,
          "en": "I saw that state briefly, but then I got an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 166.07999999999998,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "and, of course, that is that error, kind of,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 171.87,
          "en": "which we saw before earlier in the course already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 171.87,
          "end": 174.24,
          "en": "because when using useActionState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.24,
          "end": 178.29,
          "en": "your action function will no longer get this form data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 178.29,
          "end": 179.883,
          "en": "as a first parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.75,
          "end": 184.17,
          "en": "Instead, it will now get the previous state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 184.17,
          "end": 185.583,
          "en": "as a first parameter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 187.17,
          "end": 189.453,
          "en": "so this action function must be changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.19,
          "end": 195.57,
          "en": "With that, again, if we pick some items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 195.57,
          "end": 199.713,
          "en": "go to checkout, and enter our data here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 206.79,
          "en": "now you see Sending order appeared there briefly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 206.79,
          "end": 209.64,
          "en": "and we would see it a bit longer if we added a delay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 209.64,
          "end": 211.68,
          "en": "to the back end again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 211.68,
          "end": 213.48,
          "en": "so if we go to the back end code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 213.48,
          "end": 216.03,
          "en": "and there to the post orders route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 216.03,
          "end": 219.12,
          "en": "we could add code like this to await a promise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.12,
          "end": 221.313,
          "en": "that will resolve after one second,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 225.75,
          "en": "and if you do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.75,
          "end": 228.69299999999998,
          "en": "and you restart that back end code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 230.01,
          "end": 232.383,
          "en": "and we go through that process again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 240.03,
          "en": "you'll see that text a bit longer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 240.03,
          "end": 241.863,
          "en": "so that works the way it should.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 242.76,
          "end": 246.39,
          "en": "Now, of course, we could do more here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 246.39,
          "end": 249.51,
          "en": "We could, for example, also use this action state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 249.51,
          "end": 250.917,
          "en": "to manage some formState",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 250.917,
          "end": 253.29,
          "en": "and to show some validation errors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 253.29,
          "end": 256.713,
          "en": "in case the user does submit invalid values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 257.88,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "Though, of course, we already have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 263.61,
          "en": "some basic browser-based validation in place here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 263.61,
          "end": 265.77,
          "en": "where I am getting some warnings already",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 265.77,
          "end": 267.66,
          "en": "if I do omit values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 267.66,
          "end": 269.7,
          "en": "so we're relying on the browser here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 269.7,
          "end": 273.6,
          "en": "and, of course, we can still do that when using formActions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 273.6,
          "end": 275.733,
          "en": "There's nothing wrong with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 276.63,
          "end": 279.9,
          "en": "That's why here I also won't add any extra logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 279.9,
          "end": 282.84000000000003,
          "en": "to use formAction-based validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 282.84000000000003,
          "end": 285.75,
          "en": "in addition to the browser-based validation,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 285.75,
          "end": 289.023,
          "en": "but you could, of course, do that in your projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 290.13,
          "end": 294.3,
          "en": "but with that, this is how we could migrate this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 294.3,
          "end": 296.01,
          "en": "to use formActions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.01,
          "end": 299.64,
          "en": "instead of manually handling form submissions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 299.64,
          "end": 302.31,
          "en": "and, as mentioned before, it simply is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 302.31,
          "end": 304.26,
          "en": "which approach you prefer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 304.26,
          "end": 306.453,
          "en": "Now, you saw both in action.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}